(6408355, 950605, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a view not much noticed. Rugged and natural surroundings. The shot is lacking in any color and would probably be better in B&amp;W. The bright light is a problem area. It does look like nature is going to win!!</td>', 'This is a view not much noticed. Rugged and natural surroundings. The shot is lacking in any color and would probably be better in B&W. The bright light is a problem area. It does look like nature is going to win!!', '2011-05-09 09:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
