(6408360, 950305, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very cool Cross processing! You can really see all the greens, reds and blues across the entire image! The fence is the main subject which is fine, but I think this needs something more to make it a little more dynamic... people waling, a pop of color such as a beach ball, just a little something more.</td>', 'Very cool Cross processing! You can really see all the greens, reds and blues across the entire image! The fence is the main subject which is fine, but I think this needs something more to make it a little more dynamic... people waling, a pop of color such as a beach ball, just a little something more.', '2011-05-09 09:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408361, 950437, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the mood and long shadows. :)</td>', 'Love the mood and long shadows. :)', '2011-05-09 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
