(6408363, 950303, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the mood.  Almost has that fairy tale feel.  I like it.</td>', 'Love the mood.  Almost has that fairy tale feel.  I like it.', '2011-05-09 09:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
