(6408368, 950544, 10785, '<td valign="top">You got a dark and moody image using the color. It does seem a hair underexposed, which is probably what gave it the darkness, rather than just being the natural light.</td>', 'You got a dark and moody image using the color. It does seem a hair underexposed, which is probably what gave it the darkness, rather than just being the natural light.', '2011-05-09 09:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
