(6408600, 950568, 96751, '<td valign="top">I kept wanting to hit the "next" button, but just kept exploring the image for some reason.  Little bits and pieces seemed to tease me to stay, as if telling me there was more to discover.  I started at the top, with the curving S smudge, inspected the little bits sticking out of the wall, traveled down the vertical line, checked out the vent and the incredible noose-like shadow of the street lamp, and then... YOU!</td>', 'I kept wanting to hit the "next" button, but just kept exploring the image for some reason.  Little bits and pieces seemed to tease me to stay, as if telling me there was more to discover.  I started at the top, with the curving S smudge, inspected the little bits sticking out of the wall, traveled down the vertical line, checked out the vent and the incredible noose-like shadow of the street lamp, and then... YOU!', '2011-05-09 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408605, 950417, 61396, '<td valign="top">Thanks for teaching me some English.</td>', 'Thanks for teaching me some English.', '2011-05-09 13:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408606, 950088, 10785, '<td valign="top">You did nicely to center the fleur-de-liles and to use three of them. Some of the issues with this photo include the cluttered background, lack of detail in the black fence, and uneven lighting creating glare on the watch face and distractingly lit leaves... also I am not understanding the use of the stop watch here??</td>', 'You did nicely to center the fleur-de-liles and to use three of them. Some of the issues with this photo include the cluttered background, lack of detail in the black fence, and uneven lighting creating glare on the watch face and distractingly lit leaves... also I am not understanding the use of the stop watch here??', '2011-05-09 13:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408611, 950368, 61396, '<td valign="top">Energetic!</td>', 'Energetic!', '2011-05-09 13:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408617, 950611, 123089, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and details, the white line around the arm of the little girl maybe caused by thi high contrast could be removed easily.</td>', 'beautiful colors and details, the white line around the arm of the little girl maybe caused by thi high contrast could be removed easily.', '2011-05-09 14:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408618, 950628, 123089, '<td valign="top">nice composition and the fence bokeh is sweet.</td>', 'nice composition and the fence bokeh is sweet.', '2011-05-09 14:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408619, 949835, 61396, '<td valign="top">The wavy fence, the grain, and the b/w conversion join together and tell me this is not a safe place. Emotionally charged image (at least to me). Thanks!</td>', 'The wavy fence, the grain, and the b/w conversion join together and tell me this is not a safe place. Emotionally charged image (at least to me). Thanks!', '2011-05-09 14:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408621, 950064, 67152, '<td valign="top">Glorious</td>', 'Glorious', '2011-05-09 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408625, 950572, 123089, '<td valign="top">i like the triangle formed by the fence and the trees line i wish the horses were looking at you or one of them, but its just me. Nice shot</td>', 'i like the triangle formed by the fence and the trees line i wish the horses were looking at you or one of them, but its just me. Nice shot', '2011-05-09 14:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408626, 950291, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene including the pier fence. Though it is more of a supporting element in the photo and not a feature element in my opinion, it does meet the challenge. You have done very well with the post processing capturing the texture in the boardwalk and the gloominess of the clouds as well as the color of the people present. It does lack interest due to the straight ahead, standing at normal height point of view. No real composition went into the making of the photo in my opinion thus prompting me to award an average score.</td>', 'Very nice scene including the pier fence. Though it is more of a supporting element in the photo and not a feature element in my opinion, it does meet the challenge. You have done very well with the post processing capturing the texture in the boardwalk and the gloominess of the clouds as well as the color of the people present. It does lack interest due to the straight ahead, standing at normal height point of view. No real composition went into the making of the photo in my opinion thus prompting me to award an average score.', '2011-05-09 14:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408629, 950576, 10785, '<td valign="top">The dark foreground which is the subject matter is really outperformed by the brightly lit colorful sky. My eyes keep going to the blue sky and leaving pile of wreckage that is acting as a fence.</td>', 'The dark foreground which is the subject matter is really outperformed by the brightly lit colorful sky. My eyes keep going to the blue sky and leaving pile of wreckage that is acting as a fence.', '2011-05-09 14:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408630, 950469, 67152, '<td valign="top">the use of crazy wide angle makes the shot</td>', 'the use of crazy wide angle makes the shot', '2011-05-09 14:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408633, 950440, 112972, '<td valign="top">This image deserves an 8+ score and I think you will either get it or will come very close to it.</td>', 'This image deserves an 8+ score and I think you will either get it or will come very close to it.', '2011-05-09 14:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6408635, 950572, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good scene, not quite interesting enough.</td>', 'Good scene, not quite interesting enough.', '2011-05-09 14:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
