(6408737, 950440, 108069, '<td valign="top">Unique, creative, fun, very cool and absolutely perfectly done, from concept to processing. If this doesn''t win blue I''m jumping in right after you. 10. Favorite.</td>', 'Unique, creative, fun, very cool and absolutely perfectly done, from concept to processing. If this doesn''t win blue I''m jumping in right after you. 10. Favorite.', '2011-05-09 16:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
