(6408771, 950624, 123089, '<td valign="top">nice composition, the processing is a bit off on the bokeh around the edge of the wood we can see a strong black and a white line..</td>', 'nice composition, the processing is a bit off on the bokeh around the edge of the wood we can see a strong black and a white line..', '2011-05-09 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
