(6408776, 950440, 40391, '<td valign="top">The first image I get to vote on and I feel I''m already looking at a ribbon winner.  You''ve gone beyond the concept of taking a photo of a fence and created a wonderful story with the perfect surroundings.  This is the sort of effort that leads me to feel this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114969" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gyaban</a>.  This is really appreciated and impressive and gets full marks from me.  Well done!</td>', 'The first image I get to vote on and I feel I''m already looking at a ribbon winner.  You''ve gone beyond the concept of taking a photo of a fence and created a wonderful story with the perfect surroundings.  This is the sort of effort that leads me to feel this is  gyaban.  This is really appreciated and impressive and gets full marks from me.  Well done!', '2011-05-09 17:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
