(6409030, 950578, 114225, '<td valign="top">Make sure to watch out for blown highlights in a shot like this. Those areas are really detracting from the scene, which could be very beautiful. Also, I would recommend using a smaller aperture to get more of the scene in focus.</td>', 'Make sure to watch out for blown highlights in a shot like this. Those areas are really detracting from the scene, which could be very beautiful. Also, I would recommend using a smaller aperture to get more of the scene in focus.', '2011-05-09 23:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
