(6409623, 950424, 16148, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but wish the background wasn''t so busy.  Your shallow DOF is great but the bright greens and lines compete with the barbed wire.  7 from me.</td>', 'I like the idea but wish the background wasn''t so busy.  Your shallow DOF is great but the bright greens and lines compete with the barbed wire.  7 from me.', '2011-05-10 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
