(6409655, 950416, 132010, '<td valign="top">Great photo, beautiful colors, dramatic sky, great placement of the fence in the composition. There are situations where the horizon can be centered but imho this is not one of them. I would suggest cropping about 20% off the top of the sky, right above the rays.</td>', 'Great photo, beautiful colors, dramatic sky, great placement of the fence in the composition. There are situations where the horizon can be centered but imho this is not one of them. I would suggest cropping about 20% off the top of the sky, right above the rays.', '2011-05-10 18:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
