(6410433, 950610, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am not sure that the fencepost works in this shot; its a lovely shot otherwise but that is a bit distracting. I know th eshot is supposed to be about fences but the barbed wire would do quite nicely alone.</td>', 'I am not sure that the fencepost works in this shot; its a lovely shot otherwise but that is a bit distracting. I know th eshot is supposed to be about fences but the barbed wire would do quite nicely alone.', '2011-05-11 09:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
