(6410890, 950545, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice scene, but there are lots of artifacts and blotchiness in the sky. The file size is reasonable for the image, but this still looks like the results of excessive compression when it was saved somewhere along the way.</td>', 'A nice scene, but there are lots of artifacts and blotchiness in the sky. The file size is reasonable for the image, but this still looks like the results of excessive compression when it was saved somewhere along the way.', '2011-05-11 14:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
