(6414159, 950358, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nicely blurred background and good tonal range.</td>', 'Nicely blurred background and good tonal range.', '2011-05-15 16:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414161, 950023, 62249, '<td valign="top">Composition is kind of ho-hum. Yes, you''ve shown us a fence, but you haven''t shown us anything interesting or informative about a fence. The shot is well exposed, though.</td>', 'Composition is kind of ho-hum. Yes, you''ve shown us a fence, but you haven''t shown us anything interesting or informative about a fence. The shot is well exposed, though.', '2011-05-15 16:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414162, 950609, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Definitely has a dreamy feel to it.</td>', 'Lovely. Definitely has a dreamy feel to it.', '2011-05-15 16:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414163, 950117, 62249, '<td valign="top">Colorful.</td>', 'Colorful.', '2011-05-15 17:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414165, 950400, 62249, '<td valign="top">A little too saturated and contrasty for my taste, but I like the point of view you  chose.</td>', 'A little too saturated and contrasty for my taste, but I like the point of view you  chose.', '2011-05-15 17:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414167, 950424, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good title &amp; nice juxtaposition of old &amp; new. The two lighter lines in the background (grass, I assume) are distracting.</td>', 'Good title & nice juxtaposition of old & new. The two lighter lines in the background (grass, I assume) are distracting.', '2011-05-15 17:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414168, 950016, 62249, '<td valign="top">Kinda cute, but too many things going on in this composition. Viewers have a hard time deciding if the subject is the fence, the horse, the tree, or the vehicle.</td>', 'Kinda cute, but too many things going on in this composition. Viewers have a hard time deciding if the subject is the fence, the horse, the tree, or the vehicle.', '2011-05-15 17:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414169, 950471, 62249, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to get good results shooting in bright, contrasty, midday light. The composition is okay and it leads a viewer''s eye through the photo well, but your midtones are underexposed, and you''ve got too much blotchiness in the clouds and the upper left corner.</td>', 'It''s hard to get good results shooting in bright, contrasty, midday light. The composition is okay and it leads a viewer''s eye through the photo well, but your midtones are underexposed, and you''ve got too much blotchiness in the clouds and the upper left corner.', '2011-05-15 17:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414170, 950303, 62249, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks like an enchanted forest. Good use of light areas to draw viewers'' attention to the path and the trees.</td>', 'Definitely looks like an enchanted forest. Good use of light areas to draw viewers'' attention to the path and the trees.', '2011-05-15 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414171, 950362, 62249, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lovely painterly feel to it.</td>', 'This shot has a lovely painterly feel to it.', '2011-05-15 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414176, 950605, 62249, '<td valign="top">We need to see more of the fence to set the context for the tree trunk.</td>', 'We need to see more of the fence to set the context for the tree trunk.', '2011-05-15 17:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414177, 950552, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but think it might be improved a bit by cropping off a LOT of the foreground, turning it into a horizontal shot. I''m usually a fan of square crops, but I don''t think it does this image justice.</td>', 'I like this shot but think it might be improved a bit by cropping off a LOT of the foreground, turning it into a horizontal shot. I''m usually a fan of square crops, but I don''t think it does this image justice.', '2011-05-15 17:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414182, 950586, 62249, '<td valign="top">Was this taken at Sunset Crater?</td>', 'Was this taken at Sunset Crater?', '2011-05-15 17:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414185, 950485, 62249, '<td valign="top">Underexposed. It''s hard to shoot in bright, contrasty light.</td>', 'Underexposed. It''s hard to shoot in bright, contrasty light.', '2011-05-15 17:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414187, 950064, 62249, '<td valign="top">Love it! You have an excellent eye to see this.</td>', 'Love it! You have an excellent eye to see this.', '2011-05-15 17:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414188, 950610, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Would make a good Valentine. Lighting on the fence post really draws a viewer''s eye to the right area of the image.</td>', 'Very nice. Would make a good Valentine. Lighting on the fence post really draws a viewer''s eye to the right area of the image.', '2011-05-15 17:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414190, 950528, 62249, '<td valign="top">Love the way the light hits the parasol.</td>', 'Love the way the light hits the parasol.', '2011-05-15 17:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414194, 950031, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice deep cool tones, and I like how the wires of the fence frame the horizon.</td>', 'Nice deep cool tones, and I like how the wires of the fence frame the horizon.', '2011-05-15 17:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414195, 950245, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of elements in this composition.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of elements in this composition.', '2011-05-15 17:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414197, 950094, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about zoo shots in general -- or zoos for that matter (there''s only one species of animal I''m interested in at any zoo). But this shows the cruelty of captivity to a mild extent, and on that level, it works for me.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about zoo shots in general -- or zoos for that matter (there''s only one species of animal I''m interested in at any zoo). But this shows the cruelty of captivity to a mild extent, and on that level, it works for me.', '2011-05-15 17:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414199, 950424, 76335, '<td valign="top">A bizarre sort of copulation...</td>', 'A bizarre sort of copulation...', '2011-05-15 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414200, 950077, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like your use of thirds here and natural elements to frame the old barn. The dark tones work too.</td>', 'I do like your use of thirds here and natural elements to frame the old barn. The dark tones work too.', '2011-05-15 17:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414201, 950231, 76335, '<td valign="top">Niec varied layers in this.</td>', 'Niec varied layers in this.', '2011-05-15 17:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414202, 950134, 76335, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the dreamy vignette -- a milder one or none at all would have been fine. The tones are pleasing.</td>', 'Don''t care for the dreamy vignette -- a milder one or none at all would have been fine. The tones are pleasing.', '2011-05-15 17:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414203, 950312, 76335, '<td valign="top">Stark nothingness. Good.</td>', 'Stark nothingness. Good.', '2011-05-15 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414204, 950471, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like that the path takes us to the beach (clearly -- even sans title) but that the beach is out of view. What a thrill.</td>', 'I like that the path takes us to the beach (clearly -- even sans title) but that the beach is out of view. What a thrill.', '2011-05-15 17:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414206, 950609, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well, this is eye candy, but even I enjoy a piece of candy now and then. As titles go, I thought this one unnecessary, until Satchmo started singing in my head. And then it all kind of came together -- against my will. <br/> <br/>But why resist?</td>', 'Well, this is eye candy, but even I enjoy a piece of candy now and then. As titles go, I thought this one unnecessary, until Satchmo started singing in my head. And then it all kind of came together -- against my will.  But why resist?', '2011-05-15 17:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414207, 950440, 76335, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling he''ll land on the front page or darn close to it.</td>', 'I have a feeling he''ll land on the front page or darn close to it.', '2011-05-15 17:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414208, 950600, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the warm richness of your tones here. Nicely composed. Simply stated.</td>', 'I love the warm richness of your tones here. Nicely composed. Simply stated.', '2011-05-15 17:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414209, 950023, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not much to this. There is a fence...</td>', 'Not much to this. There is a fence...', '2011-05-15 18:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414210, 950362, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like a wonderful getaway -- broken fence and all.</td>', 'Looks like a wonderful getaway -- broken fence and all.', '2011-05-15 18:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414211, 950619, 76335, '<td valign="top">Who needs ''em anyway.</td>', 'Who needs ''em anyway.', '2011-05-15 18:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414212, 950444, 76335, '<td valign="top">I think if your runner were closer in the frame -- and perhaps running toward the viewer and not away -- that this would more nicely balance the distant couple and the composition overall.</td>', 'I think if your runner were closer in the frame -- and perhaps running toward the viewer and not away -- that this would more nicely balance the distant couple and the composition overall.', '2011-05-15 18:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414213, 950534, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fence works like a forbidding, foreboding overlay here. Good idea.</td>', 'Fence works like a forbidding, foreboding overlay here. Good idea.', '2011-05-15 18:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414215, 949822, 76335, '<td valign="top">The monsters of suburbia are at it again. Neat idea.</td>', 'The monsters of suburbia are at it again. Neat idea.', '2011-05-15 18:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414217, 950542, 76335, '<td valign="top">A nice simple composition that benefits from deep DOF. Could be bigger (is there an echo in here?).</td>', 'A nice simple composition that benefits from deep DOF. Could be bigger (is there an echo in here?).', '2011-05-15 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414219, 950366, 76335, '<td valign="top">The tilt adds to the unease and impending terror. The fence may not be enough!</td>', 'The tilt adds to the unease and impending terror. The fence may not be enough!', '2011-05-15 18:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414221, 950578, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like how all the elements seem to be guided by the lines of the fence. As such, this has good energy. It feels like things are moving. Quality is a little soft, but it''s forgivable.</td>', 'I do like how all the elements seem to be guided by the lines of the fence. As such, this has good energy. It feels like things are moving. Quality is a little soft, but it''s forgivable.', '2011-05-15 18:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414222, 950124, 76335, '<td valign="top">The feeling of an impending crushing about to take place. Great composition.</td>', 'The feeling of an impending crushing about to take place. Great composition.', '2011-05-15 18:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414224, 950451, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s either a little league team or white headed martians behind that fence. I''m thinking <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=811" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">karmat</a>.</td>', 'It''s either a little league team or white headed martians behind that fence. I''m thinking  karmat.', '2011-05-15 18:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414226, 950467, 76335, '<td valign="top">Each one a little different but all conforming nicely.</td>', 'Each one a little different but all conforming nicely.', '2011-05-15 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414250, 950568, 100831, '<td valign="top">great shadows... <br/>As suggested by the title, this one makes me think. I like that.</td>', 'great shadows... As suggested by the title, this one makes me think. I like that.', '2011-05-15 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414252, 950368, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love this as an abstract but as anything else I just don''t know what to make of it. Maybe that''s the point. 8</td>', 'I love this as an abstract but as anything else I just don''t know what to make of it. Maybe that''s the point. 8', '2011-05-15 18:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414253, 950549, 100831, '<td valign="top">aww... sweet. with a face like that I''m sure he/she got their way quickly.</td>', 'aww... sweet. with a face like that I''m sure he/she got their way quickly.', '2011-05-15 18:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6414254, 950548, 100831, '<td valign="top">nice colors, textures and details too.</td>', 'nice colors, textures and details too.', '2011-05-15 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1);
