(6414293, 950171, 10785, '<td valign="top">The real strength of this photo is the exposure. The composition adds a lot to it as well. Excellent point of view!</td>', 'The real strength of this photo is the exposure. The composition adds a lot to it as well. Excellent point of view!', '2011-05-15 19:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
