(6414295, 950231, 10785, '<td valign="top">I would''ve voted this higher if there had been some darker tones in this image. It is a good photo but is is mostly middle grey. I would like to see some enhanced shadows in those clouds to make them more ominous.</td>', 'I would''ve voted this higher if there had been some darker tones in this image. It is a good photo but is is mostly middle grey. I would like to see some enhanced shadows in those clouds to make them more ominous.', '2011-05-15 19:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
