(6414513, 950303, 39057, '<td valign="top">The trees overpower the fence. Also, I think of a fence as a big metal structure so this fence does not do it for me.  The shot could also use some better lighting. The bush on the left looks too out of place. Sorry but I can''t go higher than a ten!<br/> <br/>Edit: This should win easy. There is one other that may beat it. Not because of photo quality but because of a decent photo but a different take on the challenge.</td>', 'The trees overpower the fence. Also, I think of a fence as a big metal structure so this fence does not do it for me.  The shot could also use some better lighting. The bush on the left looks too out of place. Sorry but I can''t go higher than a ten! Edit: This should win easy. There is one other that may beat it. Not because of photo quality but because of a decent photo but a different take on the challenge.', '2011-05-16 00:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
